            	<h3><u>Sajana azakhana</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Azakhana, azakhana.(2)<br />
14 ho alam, ek mashkiza<br />
besheer ka ek nanha jhula<br />
do baaliya&#39;n choti bibi ki<br />
ek shamma jalakar tum rakhna<br />
aur yaad mein ho ek dulha ki<br />
kuch mehendi kangana aur sehra<br />
ghar mein yu azaa khana jo saja<br />
paoge bohot zahra ki dua..(2)</p>

<p>zahra ki dua paana sajana azakhana..(2)</p>

<p>1. Ae ehle aza e shahe huda<br />
is deher mein jab tak ho zinda<br />
tehzeeb e azadari hai yehi<br />
do kaam zaruri tum karna..(2)<br />
majlis mein chale aana, sajana azakhana<br />
zahra ki dua paana sajana azakhana..(2)</p>

<p>2. An amta alayhim ki ayat<br />
ya phir rehman ka ho surah<br />
shamil hai azakhana usmein<br />
nemat ka jaha&#39;n bhi zikr hua..(2)<br />
nemat ko na thukrana, sajana azakhana<br />
zahra ki dua paana sajana azakhana..(2)</p>

<p>3. Be dast hua saqqa lekin<br />
usne na alam ko jhukne diya<br />
pehchan e aza khana hai alam<br />
paigham yehi abbas ka tha..(2)<br />
duniya se na ghabrana, sajana azakhana<br />
zahra ki dua paana sajana azakhana</p>

<p>4. Tazeem kabhi na kam karna<br />
ta hashr rahe hurmat baaqi<br />
ye sirf azakhana hi nahi<br />
armaan e dile zahra hai yehi..(2)<br />
bachho&#39;n ko ye samjhana, sajana azakhana<br />
zahra ki dua paana sajana azakhana</p>

<p>5. Jis waqt chhida tha mashkiza<br />
jab aayi khabar ghazi na raha<br />
kuch kooze pyaase baccho ke<br />
haatho&#39;n se gire aur toot gaye..(2)<br />
kuch kooze bhi rakhwana, sajana azakhana<br />
zahra ki dua paana sajana azakhana</p>

<p>6. Rahib ki tarha mil jaye pisar<br />
ya hurr ke tarha bakhshe jao<br />
fir shukr adaa karne ke liye<br />
tum bhi ye saleeqa apnao..(2)<br />
aise ho ye shukrana, sajana azakhana<br />
zahra ki dua paana sajana azakhana</p>

<p>7. Shabbir ye zainab se bole<br />
kuch kaam abhi bhi baaqi hai<br />
zalim jo shaheedo&#39;n ke sar de<br />
wo pehle azakhane mein sajein..(2)<br />
jab shaam bahan jaana, sajana azakhana<br />
zahra ki dua paana sajana azakhana</p>

<p>8. Salman ke meesum ke jis din<br />
aamal liye jayein yakja<br />
jab tum se sawaal malak puche<br />
duniya mein kiya kya kaam bhala..(2)<br />
tum fakhr se likhwana, sajana azakhana<br />
zahra ki dua paana sajana azakhana</p>
</p>
